# Erdős Problem #99 — necessary pocket roughness in the pure rhombic branch

**Phase 2 preservation provenance:** PR #576, branch research/target-b-global-coupling-20260925, audited source head 73ea65f3d26fee2f20c004fb0139e049383d34e0. This later report corrects the attempted canonical use of PR #564: its Q_U=o(D) antecedent cannot occur in the stated canonical pure-disk survivor; the finite inequality remains unrefuted, while deep-boundary concentration is the corrected consequence.

